abstract: >
  The Human Reference Atlas (HRA) for the healthy, adult body is being developed by a team
  of international, interdisciplinary experts across 25+ consortia. It provides standard
  terminologies and data structures for describing specimens, biological structures, and
  spatial positions of experimental datasets...
